sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI / SDK
    participant Gateway as OpenShell Gateway<br/>8080/TCP gRPC+HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Supervisor as Supervisor<br/>5500/TCP mTLS
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox Runtime<br/>Static Binary
    participant Agent as Agent Workload
    participant Upstream as Upstream API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over CLI,Upstream: Flow 1: Sandbox Creation and Agent Execution

    CLI->>Gateway: CreateSandbox (gRPC)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / OIDC Bearer
    Gateway->>Gateway: Authenticate (OIDC / mTLS)<br/>Check workspace RBAC
    Gateway->>K8sAPI: Create Sandbox CR + Pod<br/>HTTPS / ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Gateway: Pod scheduled
    Gateway->>Supervisor: Bootstrap connection<br/>mTLS + Peer JWT

    Note over Supervisor,Sandbox: Supervisor and Sandbox co-located in pod

    Sandbox->>Supervisor: Exchange (Sandbox Protocol)<br/>mTLS + Sandbox JWT
    Supervisor-->>Sandbox: Policy + configuration

    Agent->>Sandbox: Execute command
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Seccomp mediation<br/>Filesystem access check

    Agent->>Supervisor: Outbound HTTP request<br/>L7 proxy
    Supervisor->>Supervisor: Policy evaluation (OPA/Rego)<br/>DNS resolution
    Supervisor->>Supervisor: Inject provider credentials<br/>AWS SigV4 / Bearer token
    Supervisor->>Upstream: Proxied request<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+ / Injected credentials
    Upstream-->>Supervisor: API response
    Supervisor-->>Agent: Proxied response

    Supervisor->>Gateway: ConnectSupervisor (gRPC)<br/>mTLS + Sandbox JWT

    Note over CLI,Upstream: Flow 2: SSH Session to Sandbox

    CLI->>Gateway: CreateSshSession (gRPC)<br/>TLS 1.2+ / OIDC Bearer
    Gateway->>Supervisor: SSH relay (gRPC)<br/>mTLS / Sandbox JWT
    Supervisor->>Sandbox: SSH over Sandbox Protocol<br/>mTLS / Ed25519 key
    Sandbox-->>Supervisor: Terminal output
    Supervisor-->>Gateway: Relay stream
    Gateway-->>CLI: SSH session data
